    <http://example.org/node/chunk163> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information and reduce energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk164> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must rely on infrastructures with low carbon impact as much as possible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk165> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what sustainable design choices can our company's make for The solution, and how will our company's measure The solution environmental impact?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk166> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To limit the environmental footprint of the client's systems of information and reduce energetic consumption, our company's, can make several sustainable design choices." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk167> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's can leverage our company's green hosting partners, OVHcloud and Scaleway, both located in France and utilizing 100% renewable energy, to host The solution. leverage aligns with the requirement of relying on infrastructures with low carbon impact as much as possible." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk168> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, our company's can implement digital sobriety practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputations by an estimated 20%, and adhering to a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk169> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices will help minimize the environmental footprint of The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk17> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A high level of relevance of the answers is expected. 5.2 Availability The expected solution will have to guarantee a high level of availability, compatible with the needs of the municipal services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk170> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Thirdly, our company's can ensure responsible e-waste management through our company's partnership with Ecologic, a certified WEEE recycling facility in France, to handle electronic waste generated during the deployment and maintenance of The solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To measure the environmental impact of The solution, our company's can utilize our company's carbon reporting capability, which is based on the GRI Standards (albeit partial)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will enable our company's to monitor and report on the carbon footprint of our company's operations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that our company's typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%, our company's anticipate a significant decrease in energetic consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, it's worth noting that as of 2024, our company's has an EcoVadis rating of Silver with a score of 62, indicating our company's commitment to sustainability and corporate social responsibility. our company's total Scope 1 & 2 tCO2e emissions were 148, and our company's aim to reach net zero by 2040." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By incorporating these sustainable design choices and measurement strategies into The solution, our company's can effectively contribute to reducing the client's environmental footprint while aligning with our company's own sustainability goals and commitments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "**Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents** We are pleased to submit Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents in response to the call for tenders issued by the City of Belval for the implementation of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in agents administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We team has carefully reviewed the requirements and constraints outlined in the tender document, and We are confident that an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities meets the needs of the City of Belval. **Introduction** the City of Belval is seeking to improve the efficiency and quality of the City of Belval administrative services by implementing an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activitiess. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities should provide quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, facilitate the consultation of internal procedures and applicable regulations, and enable the sharing of relevant information between agents and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents outlines a comprehensive approach to designing and deploying an AI-powered intelligent assistance tool that meets these requirements. **Solution Overview** an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities is based on a sovereign AI model that can be fine-tuned on a domain-specific corpus to provide contextualized answers to agents' queries. a sovereign AI model that can be fine-tuned on a domain-specific corpus to provide contextualized answers to agents' queries will be integrated with existing business software, such as civil status and town planning systems, electronic document management (EDM), and user directories. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will also include a user-friendly interface that allows agents to easily interact with the system and access relevant information. **Key Features** an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities includes the following key features: 1. **Assistance with information consultation**: an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will provide agents with quick access to reliable and up-to-date information from internal procedures, applicable regulations, and other relevant sources. 2. **Drafting of administrative contents**: an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will assist agents in drafting administrative letters, answers to users, and syntheses of files, ensuring that the content is accurate and compliant with regulatory requirements. 3. **Contextualization of answers**: an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will take into account the context of the agent's query and provide relevant and personalized responses. 4. **Sharing of relevant information**: an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will enable agents to share relevant information with each other and with other services, facilitating collaboration and ensuring continuity of processing. 5. **Compliance with regulatory requirements**: an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will ensure that all responses and recommendations provided by an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities comply with applicable regulations and internal procedures. **Technical Specifications** an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will be based on a cloud-based infrastructure that ensures high availability and scalability. an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will be hosted on a SecNumCloud-type infrastructure, which guarantees the sovereignty of data and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk179> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We team will work closely with the City of Belval IT department to ensure seamless integration with existing systems and infrastructure. **Deployment and Training** We propose a progressive deployment approach, starting with a pilot phase that covers a limited scope and gradually expanding to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "An objective of availability of the order of 99.9% is expected. 5.3 Integration The expected solution will have to integrate The expected solution with the existing system of information, notably: the business softwares (civil status, town planning), the electronic management of documents (EDM), the user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk180> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our team will provide comprehensive training to agents on the use of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities, ensuring that agents are comfortable and confident in using an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities. **Evaluation Criteria** Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents will be evaluated based on the following criteria: 1. **Quality and relevance of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities**: Our team will demonstrate the effectiveness of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities in providing accurate and relevant responses to agents' queries. 2. **Compliance with regulatory requirements**: We will ensure that an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities complies with all applicable regulations and internal procedures. 3. **Level of security**: an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will guarantee the sovereignty of data and comply with SecNumCloud standards. 4. **Global cost of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities**: We will provide a detailed breakdown of the costs associated with Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents, including deployment, maintenance, and training. 5. **Capacity for innovation**: Our team will demonstrate the potential for innovation and improvement in an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities. **Conclusion** In conclusion, Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents outlines a comprehensive approach to designing and deploying an AI-powered intelligent assistance tool that meets the needs of the City of Belval." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk181> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We are confident that an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities will improve the efficiency and quality of administrative services, provide quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, and facilitate collaboration between agents and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk182> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We look forward to the opportunity to discuss Proposal for the Implementation of an Artificial Intelligence Solution for Assistance to Agents in further detail and demonstrate the effectiveness of an artificial intelligence solution to assist agents in their administrative activities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message18> .

